<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended mixed in heavy trading Thursday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 21.27 to 6658.60.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 1.10 to 400.65.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.11.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1295 to 1185.</p>
<p>Volume was 502,813,220 compared with 498,815,150 on Wednesday.</p>
